OL,3,GNEWSAHow High Street shops are taking
OL,4,Aon violent shoplifters
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurning up for work each day, Darren
OL,7,Ffears he could face violence at any
OL,8,Fgiven moment.
OL,10,FHe has been stabbed with needles and
OL,11,Fheld at gunpoint during an 18-year
OL,12,Fcareer on the UK's High Street.
OL,14,FDarren is not a police officer,
OL,15,Fhowever, but a store detective - an
OL,16,Fundercover security guard who poses as
OL,17,Fa customer to catch thieves in the act.
OL,19,F"You do go home sometimes thinking,
OL,20,F'Why am I in this job?'," he tells the
OL,21,FBBC.
